      "widgets_values": [
        "Remote H3 -> remote SeedVR2, with source and restored videos saved. Two independent service URLs/model IDs; no local model loaders. This 2x example needs a SeedVR2 deployment that admits the whole H3 clip; the default single-GPU limits do not. Follow docs/seedvr2-restoration.md for the SP4 setup and hardware-qualified limits. H3 uses base weights, 50 steps and an explicit small canvas; change both services and output dimensions for your deployment. Long-video orchestration is a follow-up."
